  "title": "PURSUE N400 Word Processing",
  "description": "This dataset contains EEG recordings from a Word Processing task designed to elicit the N400 event-related potential (ERP) component, collected as part of the PURSUE project. Data were gathered from undergraduate participants at three institutions in California, Massachusetts, and Virginia during 2017 and 2018. The task paradigm follows the ERP CORE resource, and the dataset includes demographic information such as participant race.",
